# Example CODEOWNERS — adapt to your org
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS

# User-facing docs: require writer or product review when possible
/docs/user/ @your-org/tech-writers @your-org/product

# Architecture and ADRs
/docs/internal/architecture/ @your-org/tech-leads
/docs/internal/decisions/ @your-org/tech-leads

# Operations / runbooks
/docs/internal/operations/ @your-org/sre

# Shared glossary
/docs/shared/glossary.md @your-org/tech-leads @your-org/tech-writers
